    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/1583f0b860585b9f32534f080663457d.avif?t=1667321800\" /></div><br><br>SM Fly: Ice Age is an exciting adventure platformer with gravity switching.<br><br>Feature of game:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Changing gravity in 4 directions;<br></li><li>Physics;<br></li><li>Snowy mountains, but you are not in danger of cold;<br></li><li>Convenient gravity control;<br></li><li>Progress;<br></li><li>Strong main character, he is afraid only of sharp saws.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/0c6d236ea93b6d25be60e3c9199e3a4c.poster.avif?t=1667321800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/0c6d236ea93b6d25be60e3c9199e3a4c.webm?t=1667321800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/0c6d236ea93b6d25be60e3c9199e3a4c.mp4?t=1667321800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The main character is Mr. SM!<br>In the game, you control a black alien with one eye, but not directly, but by directing it through the level collecting coins and moving to new levels through a teleport.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/1583f0b860585b9f32534f080663457d.avif?t=1667321800\" /></div><br><br>SM Fly: Ice Age is an exciting adventure platformer with gravity switching.<br><br>Feature of game:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Changing gravity in 4 directions;<br></li><li>Physics;<br></li><li>Snowy mountains, but you are not in danger of cold;<br></li><li>Convenient gravity control;<br></li><li>Progress;<br></li><li>Strong main character, he is afraid only of sharp saws.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/0c6d236ea93b6d25be60e3c9199e3a4c.poster.avif?t=1667321800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/0c6d236ea93b6d25be60e3c9199e3a4c.webm?t=1667321800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447080/extras/0c6d236ea93b6d25be60e3c9199e3a4c.mp4?t=1667321800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The main character is Mr. SM!<br>In the game, you control a black alien with one eye, but not directly, but by directing it through the level collecting coins and moving to new levels through a teleport.",
